Ravana scatters monkey ranks --- Sugriva posts Sushena and advances with tree --- Chiefs follow with mountains and trees --- Sugriva rains mountains and crushes rakshasas --- Virupaksha leaps from chariot to elephant --- Virupaksha rallies rakshasas and pierces Sugriva --- Sugriva smashes his elephant with a tree --- Virupaksha dodges rock and strips Sugriva armor --- Fighters trade palm blows and fist punches --- Sugriva crushes his temple and fells him